The Daily Visual Shield: Do not let infants sleep in rooms that are completely dark and completely silent. Recite Ayatul Kursi, Surah al-Falaq, and Surah an-Nas over them before they sleep, and literally blow your breath across their crib. This forms a wall of light that blinds any roaming entities looking to feed on the child's pure, innocent energy.
By transforming your entire home into an active, high-vibrational outpost of the Ahl al-Bayt, you completely turn the tables on the unseen world. You cease to be a target, and instead become a dangerous disruption to the dark empires of this world and the next.
