The Blockade of Prayers
In the unseen realm, enemy Jinn position themselves to act as a psychic blockade. When a human prays with zero focus, that prayer has no weight and is easily intercepted or neutralized by these roaming entities.
But when a believer weaponizes their prayer via Namaz with total presence of mind, that prayer shoots through the unseen realm like a directed plasma beam, obliterating any dark Jinn blockades in its path and landing straight into the divine treasury, accelerating the ultimate timeline of the Raj'at.
