How the 313 commanders use this exact Psychic Fire to instantly paralyze entire armies of human oppressors and their hidden Jinn handlers?
The specific methods taught by the Imams to diagnose exactly what kind of Jinn (Marid, Ifrit, etc.) is attaching to a space?
